[{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32400100_01_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32400100_01_0010","text":"………………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32400100_01_0020","text":"……？　怎么了？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32400100_01_0030","text":"──────啊\n……对、对不起……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32400100_01_0040","text":"那个……──护手霜！\n您用的是哪一款呢……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32400100_01_0050","text":"美琴小姐用的那个\n感觉，好像很好的样子……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32400100_01_0060","text":"……怎么说呢"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32400100_01_0070","text":"是认识的造型师\n送给我的，所以不太清楚呢"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32400100_01_0080","text":"……要用吗？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32400100_01_0090","text":"啊，那怎么好意思……不、不用了！\n啊，谢谢您……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32400100_01_0100","text":"是吗……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32400100_01_0101","text":"Motion"}]
